{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56991","headline":"鹦鹉谷水世语（题从《古谣谚》卷三十二） · 佚名","name":"鹦鹉谷水世语（题从《古谣谚》卷三十二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此水清，天下平。\n（《唐会要》卷二十八）（按：《唐会要》云：「武德元年十二月，新丰鹦鹉谷水清。\n世传云云。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}